  "scope": "a=3; b=2; c=sqrt(a^2-b^2); rad=t*pi/180; px=a*cos(rad); py=b*sin(rad); r1=sqrt((px+c)^2+py^2); r2=sqrt((px-c)^2+py^2); prod=r1*r2; minprod=b^2",
